<tr class="mktoModule" id="Body_copy"> 
<td align="center" valign="top"> 
<table width="640" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center" style="width:640px;" class="em_wrapper" bgcolor="#ffffff"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" style="padding:40px 42px 0px 42px;" class="em_ptrl1"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#223341; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;" class="em_green"> 
<div id="text_01" class="mktoText"> 
<p style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 20px; color: #000000;">Welcome to the final healthcare newsletter of 2020!&nbsp;</span><br /> <br /><span style="font-size: 20px; color: #000000;">As we look to close out the last days of 2020 and turn our attention to 2021, we thought it would be prudent to take a brief moment to reflect on our collective accomplishments during such difficult times. </span><br /> <br /><span style="font-size: 20px; color: #000000;">Undoubtedly, it starts with the health systems we partner with. Despite the many challenges that came in 2020, the vision, compassion, and resilience providers have shown has been truly inspiring. During a time when patients find themselves not only concerned about their health but also their personal finances, these health care providers have been proactive in supporting patients with flexible payment options.</span><br /> <br /><span style="font-size: 20px; color: #000000;">As the pandemic continues, patients will need that consideration more than ever in 2021 and we’re committed to helping our clients meet this challenge. </span><br /> <br /><span style="font-size: 20px; color: #000000;">For our part, Flywire navigated a very successful acquisition of Simplee, utilized our platform to help our clients engage patients with responsive payment support, signed and deployed a record number of health systems even during the peak of the pandemic, and focused on providing timely, thought leadership to the market that hopefully helped providers make informed decisions regarding their business at critical times during the year (you can find highlights of that content below).</span><br /> <br /><span style="font-size: 20px; color: #000000;">Thank you for reading and have a safe and happy new year! We’ll see you in 2021!</span><br /> <br /><span style="font-size: 20px; color: #000000;">-John Talaga, EVP &amp; GM Healthcare, Flywire.</span><br /></p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
</tbody> 
</table></td> 
</tr> 
</tbody> 
</table></td> 
</tr>
